// fastpki-web — the web management console.
//
// Serves a single-page admin/auditor console plus a small JSON API over the
// existing database, reusing the same Db the servers use:
//
//   GET /                  -> the console (static HTML + vanilla JS)
//   GET /api/certs         -> managed inventory; ?q=&status=&sort=&order= +
//                             X-Total-Count for server-side search/sort (5.1)
//   GET /api/certs/<serial>-> full decoded detail for one cert (SANs, key, PEM)
//   GET /api/audit         -> tamper-evident audit log, newest   (audit_log)
//   GET /api/discovered    -> discovered/unmanaged certs
//   GET /api/config        -> effective server config, secrets redacted (admin)
//   GET /api/compliance    -> weak-key / SHA-1 / expiry risk report (admin)
//   GET /api/summary       -> headline counts for the dashboard
//   POST /api/certs/<serial>/revoke -> revoke a cert (admin; WEB_ALLOW_REVOKE)
//   GET /healthz           -> liveness
//
// This slice is strictly READ-ONLY — there are no issuance/revocation/config
// write paths. Bind defaults to loopback; an
// optional bearer token (WEB_TOKEN) gates /api/*. Front it with a
// TLS-terminating reverse proxy in production.

