  // ⚠️ A group with NO members at all stays on both pages ON PURPOSE. Hiding it would make
  // it unreachable — there would be no row to select, edit or delete, so a grant nobody can
  // see becomes a grant nobody can remove. It is also the state a misconfigured directory
  // produces (a search base that reaches none of its members), and that must stay visible
  // rather than vanish into a page the operator is not looking at.
