  // so pasting that URI back in here is the natural mistake, and it used to be
  // concatenated blindly into `?pin-source=pkcs11:token=…`. That URI is accepted by the
  // form, stored on the CA, and only fails later at key load with an error naming
  // neither the field nor the form. Recover the path instead of building the garbage,
  // and write it back so the operator SEES what was submitted rather than a silent fix.
