      // RA" gave a blank Key name — and because that field is
      // `required`, the form then refused to submit with nothing said at all. Now
      // this is the NORMAL state for the CMP RA, SCEP RA and OCSP responder on a fresh
      // install: their keys are deliberately not minted at install time.
